      "text_chunk": "COMMONWEALTH OF VIRGINIA LEGISLATION Bill ID: HB-1526 | Enactment Year: 2020 Title: Virginia Clean Economy Act Jurisdiction: Commonwealth of Virginia SUMMARY OF ENACTED LAW: Establishes renewable portfolio standards and mandates zero-carbon electricity generation by 2045. Official Record URL: https://lis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?201+sum+HB1526 CHAPTER 402 - AN ACT to amend and reenact Code of Virginia provisions relating to governance, energy, housing Be it enacted by the General Assembly of Virginia: 1. That the Code of Virginia is amended by adding sections relating to Virginia Clean Economy Act. 2. That all regulations adopted under this Act shall take effect pursuant to Virginia law.",
